// 15 FPS floor on the integration step, matching Hecton_FluidAdvection and AbyssalBlackSmoke. Both marine
// snow kernels integrate acceleration straight into Vel, so an unclamped hitch step displaces the whole
// buffer in a single frame. It also bounds the error in the linear `saturate(dt * k)` velocity relaxations
// used below, which diverge from true exponential relaxation as dt grows and reach a full snap at dt >= 1/k.
#define MARINE_SNOW_MAX_DT 0.0666667

